  - behavioral-modes, Behavioral Modes, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill behavioral-modes, .agents/skills/behavioral-modes, assess_for_task, "AI operational modes (brainstorm, implement, debug, review, teach, ship, orchestrate). Use to adapt behavior based on task type."
