  - colab-cloud-execution, Colab Cloud Execution, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill colab-cloud-execution, .agents/skills/colab-cloud-execution, assess_for_task, "Provision remote Google Colab GPU/TPU/CPU runtimes and execute Python scripts, notebooks, or shell workloads headlessly via the official Google Colab CLI (`colab`)."
  - cold-email, Cold Email, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill cold-email, .agents/skills/cold-email, assess_for_task, "Write B2B cold emails and follow-up sequences that earn replies. Use when creating outbound prospecting emails, SDR outreach, personalized opening lines, subject lines, CTAs, and multi-touch follow-up sequences."
  - collabs-and-cross-promotion, Collabs And Cross Promotion, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill collabs-and-cross-promotion, .agents/skills/collabs-and-cross-promotion, assess_for_task, "Creator collabs and cross-promotion , organic creator-to-creator partnerships that swap audiences. Use when someone wants to set up a collab, audience swap, cross-promotion, shoutout swap, joint giveaway, guest spot, joint video/series, a YouTube/IG collab post, or co-promo with another creator. Picks a complementary, similar-size, values-aligned partner, agrees the plan before creating, and co-creates shared-value content (not a bare shoutout) on a coordinated schedule. Uses the UNITE framework. Reads brand-profile + goals-and-kpis first. WoopSocial publishes each partner's OWN posts to their OWN accounts; it does NOT create native IG Collab co-authored posts, run giveaways, duet/stitch, or manage the agreement. A pure mutual collab isn't a sponsorship, but payment/free product makes it one -> disclose -> ugc-and-influencer; partnerships must be genuine; metrics never fabricated. Distinct from ugc-and-influencer (brand->creator) and creator-monetization (the creator's income)."
  - collections-dunning-automation, Collections Dunning Automation, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill collections-dunning-automation, .agents/skills/collections-dunning-automation, assess_for_task, "Operate the collections ladder from gentle reminder to bad-debt provision. Use when AR ages past 60 days, when a dunning stage fires, or when provisioning is due for the quarter. Excludes disputed invoices until the dispute closes, and hands legal-grade escalations to the operator for a human decision."
  - comfyui-gateway, Comfyui Gateway, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill comfyui-gateway, .agents/skills/comfyui-gateway, assess_for_task, "REST API gateway for ComfyUI servers. Workflow management, job queuing, webhooks, caching, auth, rate limiting, and image delivery (URL + base64)."
  - comic-creator, Comic Creator, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill comic-creator, .agents/skills/comic-creator, assess_for_task, "Knowledge comic creator supporting multiple art styles and tones. Creates original educational comics with detailed panel layouts and sequential image generation. Use when user asks to create ""知识漫画"", ""教育漫画"", ""biography comic"", ""tutorial comic"", or ""Logicomix-style comic""."
  - community-management, Community Management, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill community-management, .agents/skills/community-management, assess_for_task, "Use to build a genuine community , turning an audience into people who interact with each other, not just with the brand. Run when the user asks how to build community, support belonging/loyalty, create superfans, start a group/Discord channel, get members talking to each other, or move beyond chasing followers/virality. Reads brand-profile/social-strategy/audience-research. Community outperforms virality, measured by relationship depth/retention, not follower count. Covers the audience-to-community distinction (member-to-member interaction), choosing the space (in-feed -> semi-owned -> owned groups/Discord), recurring rituals, building belonging, and nurturing superfans into advocates. KPIs read natively, never fabricated. Advisory: WoopSocial schedules the content but does NOT run Discord/Slack or show analytics , the human runs the community, the agent drafts. Never fake community; get consent before spotlighting. Pairs with reply-and-comment-writer and crisis-and-moderation."
  - community-sentiment-trends, Community Sentiment Trends, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill community-sentiment-trends, .agents/skills/community-sentiment-trends, assess_for_task, "Track community sentiment per channel and topic, alert on abnormal drops, and correlate them with releases and incidents. Use weekly for the standing digest, when support volume spikes, and before release so known friction is distinguished from new friction."
  - competitive-landscape, Competitive Landscape, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill competitive-landscape, .agents/skills/competitive-landscape, assess_for_task, "Comprehensive frameworks for analyzing competition, identifying differentiation opportunities, and developing winning market positioning strategies."
  - competitive-platform-analysis, Competitive Platform Analysis, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill competitive-platform-analysis, .agents/skills/competitive-platform-analysis, assess_for_task, "Use when scoping a competitive landscape , identifying, categorising, and score-filtering a competitor set before any benchmarking begins. Decides who counts as a competitor, which tier they belong to, and which sources to mine. First step in the three-skill competitive pipeline; precedes benchmark-methodology."
  - competitive-report-structure, Competitive Report Structure, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill competitive-report-structure, .agents/skills/competitive-report-structure, assess_for_task, "Assemble scored competitor profile cards (from benchmark-methodology) into a decision-grade competitive report with landscape map, competitor tiers, benchmarking matrix, white-space analysis, strategic recommendations, and team alignment trigger questions. Use when presenting competitive findings to leadership or a board, writing a competitive landscape report, or as the final step of the competitive analysis pipeline."
  - competitor-alternatives, Competitor Alternatives, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill competitor-alternatives, .agents/skills/competitor-alternatives, assess_for_task, "You are an expert in creating competitor comparison and alternative pages. Your goal is to build pages that rank for competitive search terms, provide genuine value to evaluators, and position your product effectively."
  - competitor-analysis, Competitor Analysis, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill competitor-analysis, .agents/skills/competitor-analysis, assess_for_task, "Competitor analysis for social media , public-data competitive reconnaissance to find the gap a brand can own. Use when someone wants to ""analyse/research our competitors,"" ""see what rivals are doing on social,"" ""benchmark against competitors,"" ""find content gaps / white space,"" or ""do a competitive landscape / SWOT."" Reads the PUBLIC competitive field , positioning, pillars, formats, cadence, share of voice , to find the gap the brand can own, then feeds social-strategy and content-pillars. Reads brand-profile + audience-research first. Advisory and public-data only: no scraping private data, no fake monitoring accounts, no fabricated competitor metrics, no copying. Distinct from viral-reverse-engineering (single-post teardown) and audience-research (your own audience)."
  - compliance-check, Compliance Check, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill compliance-check, .agents/skills/compliance-check, assess_for_task, "You are a compliance expert specializing in regulatory requirements for software systems including GDPR, HIPAA, SOC2, PCI-DSS, and other industry standards. Perform comprehensive compliance audits and provide implementation guidance for achieving and maintaining compliance."
