  - config-gc, Config Gc, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill config-gc, .agents/skills/config-gc, assess_for_task, "Garbage collection for your Claude Code configuration. Periodically scans ~/.claude (skills, memory, hooks, permissions, MCP servers, caches) for redundant, stale, orphaned, or low-value items, then walks the user through a confirm-each-deletion cleanup. Use when the user says ""clean up my config"", ""config GC"", ""too many skills"", ""audit my setup"", ""my .claude is bloated"", or asks for a periodic config review."
