  - iconscout-mcp, Iconscout Mcp, UI/UX & Motion, Frontend & Motion, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill iconscout-mcp, .agents/skills/iconscout-mcp, assess_for_task, "Search, inspect, and download design assets from Iconscout's library of 15M+ icons, vector illustrations, 3D icons, and Lottie animations via its MCP server. Use natural language queries to find style-consistent assets and inject them directly into codebases and design files."
  - idea-darwin, Idea Darwin, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill idea-darwin, .agents/skills/idea-darwin, assess_for_task, "Darwinian idea evolution engine , toss rough ideas onto an evolution island, let them compete, crossbreed, and mutate through structured rounds to surface your strongest concepts."
  - idea-generation-and-ideation, Idea Generation And Ideation, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill idea-generation-and-ideation, .agents/skills/idea-generation-and-ideation, assess_for_task, "The idea-system craft , never run out of content ideas by running a system instead of waiting for inspiration. Use when someone is out of ideas, stares at a blank calendar, asks where good ideas come from, wants an idea bank/backlog, feels their AI-generated ideas sound like everyone else's, or thinks their niche is ""boring."" Uses the SPARK framework. Reads brand-profile + social-strategy + content-pillars + audience-research first. The audience is the idea engine (comments/DMs/FAQs clustered into themes); AI expands real signals, it doesn't discover them; systems beat muses; trends are a timing filter, not a source. The agent clusters/expands/scores; the HUMAN supplies proprietary signals and decides; WoopSocial publishes the content, not ideas. Never rewords competitor posts, invents audience questions, or fabricates probe results. Distinct from social-strategy/content-pillars, audience-research, cross-platform-repurposing/ content-recycling, and the format skills."
  - idea-os, Idea Os, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill idea-os, .agents/skills/idea-os, assess_for_task, "Five-phase pipeline (triage → clarify → research → PRD → plan) that turns a raw idea into four linked files: clarifying questions, deep research, a PRD with non-goals and metrics, and a phased execution plan with mermaid user journey and kill criteria."
  - identity-mirror, Identity Mirror, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill identity-mirror, .agents/skills/identity-mirror, assess_for_task, "Use when adapting brand or offer messaging to reflect customers' self-image, aspirations, or in-group identity."
  - ideogram, Ideogram, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill ideogram, .agents/skills/ideogram, assess_for_task, "Use to write great prompts for Ideogram (Ideogram 4.0) to generate design-grade images for social media , the image-prompt-craft mini-skill for typography + layout, sibling to nano-banana under the image-prompt router. Run when the user wants an Ideogram / AI image prompt where TEXT and LAYOUT matter: quote cards, carousel covers, posters, logos/wordmark concepts, signage, ads with headlines, or any image that must say words correctly. Reads brand-profile for style/palette. Ideogram's standouts: best-in-class in-image text rendering, structured JSON prompting (bounding boxes, hex palettes), native 2K, transparency, and Layerize Text. Also covers the Ideogram app-editor workflow (Canvas, Magic Fill, Extend, Style References). Honest: review rendered text, disclose AI images and sign with C2PA, never generate real identifiable people or copyrighted characters/IP/logos. The API/connection and the generate -> upload to WoopSocial Media -> attach flow live in tools/integrations/ideogram.md."
  - idor-testing, Idor Testing, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill idor-testing, .agents/skills/idor-testing, assess_for_task, Provide systematic methodologies for identifying and exploiting Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR) vulnerabilities in web applications.
