  - infinite-gratitude, Infinite Gratitude, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill infinite-gratitude, .agents/skills/infinite-gratitude, assess_for_task, "Multi-agent research skill for parallel research execution (10 agents, battle-tested with real case studies)."
  - infographic-and-data-viz, Infographic And Data Viz, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill infographic-and-data-viz, .agents/skills/infographic-and-data-viz, assess_for_task, "The craft of turning real data into honest, scannable, shareable infographics and charts. Use when someone wants to visualize data, make an infographic, build a chart/graph, turn a finding or stat into a visual, or fix a chart that's confusing or misleading. A great data viz makes one insight land in 3 seconds. Uses the CHART framework (chart choice, headline takeaway, honest scale, reduce to signal, tag source + accessibility). Reads brand-profile + design-and-templates first and pulls real data from data-and-original-research / analytics-and-reporting. The agent designs the spec; a design/chart tool renders it; the human approves; WoopSocial publishes the image (it does not generate media). NEVER distorts scales or fabricates a data point/source; cites source + date; accessibility required. Distinct from design-and-templates (brand design), quote-cards-and-text-graphics (a lone quote/number), data-and-original-research (originates the data), and analytics-and-reporting."
  - infographic-gen, Infographic Gen, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill infographic-gen, .agents/skills/infographic-gen, assess_for_task, "Generate professional infographics with 21 layout types and 22 visual styles. Analyzes content, recommends layout×style combinations, and generates publication-ready infographics. Use when user asks to create ""infographic"", ""信息图"", ""visual summary"", ""可视化"", or ""高密度信息大图""."
