  - jake-replica-replica-architect, Jake Replica Replica Architect, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 1, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-replica-replica-architect, .agents/skills/jake-replica-replica-architect, assess_for_task, "Plans the stack, database schema and API for an app clone, from the recon map replica-recon wrote. Picks boring, managed tech, turns the inferred data model into real SQL with indexes and access rules, lists every route by flow, and orders the build as a thin vertical slice first. Use when the user says ""plan the clone"", ""what stack should I use"", ""design the database"", ""write the schema"", ""plan the API"", ""architecture for my version of X"", or after /replica-recon finishes."
