  - jake-replica-replica-diff, Jake Replica Replica Diff, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-replica-replica-diff, .agents/skills/jake-replica-replica-diff, assess_for_task, "Compares an app clone against the original: a feature parity score from the feature matrix (weighted by must, should, could) with the missing list in build order, plus a screenshot layout diff that ignores colour so a rebrand does not count against you. Two standard-library Python tools. Use when the user says ""how close is my clone"", ""compare it to the original"", ""what's missing"", ""parity check"", ""diff the screens"", ""is it ready"", or after /replica-test."
  - jake-replica-replica-entrepreneur, Jake Replica Replica Entrepreneur, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-replica-replica-entrepreneur, .agents/skills/jake-replica-replica-entrepreneur, assess_for_task, "Researches the app being cloned and reads what its real users say in public reviews (App Store, Google Play, G2, Capterra, Trustpilot, Reddit, Hacker News, its own feature-request board), then ranks what they hate, what is missing and what is unsolved, turns it into a fix plan for the clone and a positioning angle you can sell. Every quote is real, verbatim and linked. Use when the user says ""what do people hate about X"", ""read the reviews"", ""how do I make mine better"", ""find the gap"", ""what features are missing"", ""how do I position this"", ""make it sellable"", or after /replica-diff."
  - jake-replica-replica-launch, Jake Replica Replica Launch, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-replica-replica-launch, .agents/skills/jake-replica-replica-launch, assess_for_task, "Writes the launch for an app clone: the landing page built on the positioning angle, pricing set against the original's public pricing and its users' complaints, and the App Store and Google Play listing linted against the stores' limits and copycat rules. Use when the user says ""landing page"", ""pricing"", ""how much should I charge"", ""App Store listing"", ""store screenshots"", ""launch plan"", ""Product Hunt"", or after /replica-brand."
  - jake-replica-replica-recon, Jake Replica Replica Recon, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-replica-replica-recon, .agents/skills/jake-replica-replica-recon, assess_for_task, "Reverse-engineers any app into a recon map: screen inventory, user flows, component list, inferred data model and a feature matrix, from public pages, screenshots, app store listings, help docs and the user's own account. The first step of the Replica pack. Use when the user says ""clone this app"", ""reverse engineer X"", ""how does X work"", ""map out X"", ""what screens does X have"", ""I want to build my own version of X"", ""copy this app"", or pastes an app's URL or App Store link and wants to rebuild it."
  - jake-replica-replica-test, Jake Replica Replica Test, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-replica-replica-test, .agents/skills/jake-replica-replica-test, assess_for_task, "Clicks through every flow of an app clone and tests it for bugs: a test plan generated from the recon flows with happy paths and edge cases, Playwright end-to-end tests where possible, a browser click-through where not, and bug reports in a fixed format with severity, steps and evidence. Use when the user says ""test my clone"", ""find bugs"", ""QA this"", ""click through everything"", ""write e2e tests"", ""does it work"", or after /replica-build or /replica-backend."
  - jake-seed-seed-closer, Jake Seed Seed Closer, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-closer, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-closer, assess_for_task, "Manage investor outreach and follow-ups without sending externally without approval. Draft and review investor emails, triage replies, stop threads after declines or opt-outs, schedule calls, and maintain the raise pipeline. Use for investor email outreach, follow-ups, reply sorting, call scheduling, or raise status."
  - jake-seed-seed-coach, Jake Seed Seed Coach, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-coach, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-coach, assess_for_task, "Pitch Coach. Rehearses the investor call with you: drills the hard questions investors ask (market, competition, traction, unit economics, team, why now, risks, the ask), tailored to your own numbers from the competitor scout, the financial model, the market size and the investor you are meeting (""Rover has 515,771 ratings. Why will owners switch?""), grades your written answers (a number, specifics, no hedging, under a minute spoken, answer first) and writes a 20-minute plan for a booked first call. Reads seed/competitors.json, model.json, market.json, investors.json, pipeline.json and calls/. Use when the user says ""prep me for the call"", ""practice my pitch"", ""what will investors ask"", ""drill me"", ""grade my answer"", ""mock investor"", ""call agenda"", or after /seed-closer books a call."
  - jake-seed-seed-dataroom, Jake Seed Seed Dataroom, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-dataroom, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-dataroom, assess_for_task, "Data Room Builder. Assembles the data room investors ask for and tells you what is missing. Lays out the nine standard folders (01 Company, 02 Pitch deck, 03 Financials, 04 Market, 05 Product, 06 Team, 07 Legal, 08 Cap table, 09 Customers), checks the files against a 25-item checklist (present, missing, or stale by the date in the file name or its last change), writes seed/dataroom/INDEX.md describing every file, and lists what to share before a term sheet and what only after one. Flags what must never be in a data room: passwords, keys, ID documents, raw customer lists. It never uploads or shares anything. Use when the user says ""build my data room"", ""what goes in a data room"", ""what am I missing for diligence"", ""the investor asked for the data room"", ""what can I share now"", ""make an index of my documents"", or after a /seed-closer call goes well or /seed-terms reads a term sheet."
  - jake-seed-seed-deck, Jake Seed Seed Deck, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-deck, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-deck, assess_for_task, "Pitch Deck Designer. Turns the business plan into a 10-slide pitch deck in the order investors expect: title, problem, solution, market, competition, business model, go-to-market, team, financials, the ask. Writes ONE self-contained 16:9 HTML file (inline CSS, no fonts or scripts from the web, arrow-key navigation, a print stylesheet that saves to PDF one slide a page) in your brand colours, with real charts drawn from your numbers. Lints it: 35 words or fewer a slide, one idea a slide, a use of funds that adds up to the raise, and every number on a slide traced to your plan, model, market or competitor files. Reads seed/plan.json, writes seed/deck.html. Use when the user says ""make my pitch deck"", ""turn the plan into a deck"", ""build the slides"", ""check my deck"", ""how many words a slide"", or after /seed-plan."
  - jake-seed-seed-investors, Jake Seed Seed Investors, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-investors, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-investors, assess_for_task, "Investor Finder. Researches the best investors for your idea from public sources only (the firm's own site, public profiles found through web search, SEC EDGAR Form D filings, the press) and ranks them by fit, 0 to 100, with the reasons and a source link on every row: stage, sectors, check size against your ask, geography, how recent their last relevant deal is, and a warm intro. Reads SEC Form D filings to see who in your space raised, how much and when. Writes seed/investors.json for the Closer and the Pitch Coach. Use when the user says ""find investors"", ""who should I pitch"", ""which VCs invest in pet tech"", ""build my investor list"", ""rank these investors"", ""who funded companies like mine"", ""Form D"", or after /seed-plan, before /seed-closer."
  - jake-seed-seed-market, Jake Seed Seed Market, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-market, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-market, assess_for_task, "Market Sizer. Sizes your market the way investors check it: TAM top-down (population x share x spend a year), SAM bottom-up (customers you can reach x purchases a year x price) and SOM (the share of SAM you can win in N years, with a stated reason). Every input carries a source (a URL, a named publication, or an assumption said out loud), vague sources are refused, and it refuses any result that breaks SOM <= SAM <= TAM. Records sourced facts the deck quotes. Writes seed/market.json for the plan, the deck and the pitch coach. Use when the user says ""how big is my market"", ""TAM SAM SOM"", ""size the market"", ""market size slide"", ""is this market big enough"", or after /seed-scout, before /seed-model and /seed-plan."
  - jake-seed-seed-model, Jake Seed Seed Model, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-model, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-model, assess_for_task, "Financial Modeler. Builds the 36-month financial model behind your raise: customers, orders, GMV, revenue (GMV x your take rate), contribution, payroll, marketing (new customers x CAC), opex, net and cash, month by month, then the numbers investors ask for: runway, the breakeven month, peak burn, revenue for years 1 to 3, and the unit economics (contribution per order, CAC payback, LTV:CAC). Checks that the use of funds adds up to the raise and exports a CSV. Reads seed/assumptions.json, writes seed/model.json for the business plan, the deck and the pitch coach. Use when the user says ""build my financial model"", ""how long will the money last"", ""what's my runway"", ""when do we break even"", ""3-year projections"", ""use of funds"", ""how much should I raise"", ""unit economics"", ""burn rate"", or before /seed-plan and /seed-deck."
  - jake-seed-seed-plan, Jake Seed Seed Plan, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-plan, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-plan, assess_for_task, "Business Planner. Turns your idea into a business plan investors can read: the nine sections (executive summary, problem, solution, market, competition, business model, go-to-market, financial plan, use of funds), written with you, with the numbers pulled from the other seed skills' files: TAM, SAM and SOM from seed/market.json, competitors' weak points from seed/competitors.json, revenue, breakeven and runway from seed/model.json. Computes the unit economics (take rate, contribution per order, CAC payback, LTV:CAC) and flags empty sections and numbers that disagree between files. Writes seed/config.json, seed/plan.json and seed/plan.md. Use when the user says ""turn my idea into a business plan"", ""write my business plan"", ""I have a startup idea"", ""help me plan my startup"", ""check my plan"", ""unit economics"", or before /seed-deck."
  - jake-seed-seed-scout, Jake Seed Seed Scout, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-scout, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-scout, assess_for_task, "Competitor Scout. Finds the weak points of your competitors in their own App Store reviews: searches the App Store for the apps people already use for your idea, reads up to the 500 most recent reviews of each, sorts the one- and two-star ones into themes (fees and pricing, cancellations and no-shows, support, bugs, trust and safety, payments and refunds, availability), and names each rival's weak point with the evidence (""106 of 341 recent 1-2 star reviews mention fees""). Writes seed/reviews/ and seed/competitors.json for the plan, the deck and the pitch coach. Use when the user says ""who are my competitors"", ""find my competitors' weak points"", ""what do people hate about Rover"", ""read their reviews"", ""scout the competition"", ""competitor research"", ""why do customers leave X"", or at the start of a raise, before /seed-market."
  - jake-seed-seed-terms, Jake Seed Seed Terms, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-terms, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-terms, assess_for_task, "Explain SAFEs and term sheets in plain English, calculate dilution, build priced-round cap-table scenarios, and flag clauses that need legal review. Covers liquidation preferences, participation, ratchets, board rights, and vesting. This is analytical guidance, not legal advice."
  - jake-seed-seed-updates, Jake Seed Seed Updates, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-seed-seed-updates, .agents/skills/jake-seed-seed-updates, assess_for_task, "Investor Updates. Writes the monthly investor update that keeps investors warm: a TL;DR, every metric with its month-over-month growth, highlights, lowlights, the asks, and the runway worked out from your cash and your average net burn. A short ""prospects"" version goes to warm investors who said ""not now"": the headline numbers, two highlights, the raise and an opt-out line, with no cash or runway. Reads seed/metrics.json (and seed/config.json for the founder and the raise), writes seed/updates/YYYY-MM.md. Never sends anything on its own. Use when the user says ""write my investor update"", ""monthly update"", ""update my investors"", ""keep investors warm"", ""follow up with investors who said not now"", ""what's my runway"", ""MoM growth"", or at the start of each month."
  - jake-trader-trader-alerts, Jake Trader Trader Alerts, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-alerts, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-alerts, assess_for_task, "Price Alerts. Rings when a price target, a stop or the opening bell hits: above / below / stop rules, percent moves from the previous close, and the NYSE opening bell, each ringing once so you are not spammed. Knows NYSE hours with the 2026 and 2027 holidays and 1:00 p.m. early closes, fetches free delayed quotes (Yahoo chart JSON, Stooq CSV) one ticker at a time, and writes trader/prices.json for the other skills. Use when the user says ""alert me when"", ""tell me if AAPL hits"", ""set a stop"", ""price target"", ""watch my stocks"", ""is the market open"", ""when does the market open"", ""get me prices"", or to refresh prices before sizing, risk or tax."
  - jake-trader-trader-analyst, Jake Trader Trader Analyst, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-analyst, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-analyst, assess_for_task, "The Earnings Analyst. Reads a company's reported numbers straight from SEC EDGAR (XBRL company facts from its 10-Qs and 10-Ks, plus the latest earnings 8-K and its press release) and sums up what changed: revenue, gross, operating and net margins, net income and diluted EPS, quarter by quarter, each against the same quarter a year earlier, with the trailing twelve months. Writes a metrics file the screener reads. Use when the user says ""how did Apple's earnings look"", ""analyze the earnings"", ""what changed this quarter"", ""is revenue growing"", ""check the 10-Q"", ""compare margins"", or ""run the analyst on my holdings""."
  - jake-trader-trader-broker, Jake Trader Trader Broker, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-broker, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-broker, assess_for_task, "Order Executor. Places APPROVED orders through your brokerage connector, one at a time, and never without your explicit yes. Shows each order as a plain ticket plus the exact JSON for Alpaca's place_stock_order, records your yes word for word, then Claude's own Allow once / Deny card asks again. Covers setting up Alpaca's official MCP server in Claude Desktop (paper trading by default, keys in env vars, never in chat), the Interactive Brokers connector (orders go to your IBKR account for your approval), and setting order tools to ""Needs approval"". Use when the user says ""place the orders"", ""buy it"", ""execute"", ""send it to my broker"", ""connect Alpaca"", ""connect Interactive Brokers"", ""set up paper trading"", or after /trader-risk passes."
  - jake-trader-trader-budget, Jake Trader Trader Budget, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-budget, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-budget, assess_for_task, "Budget Manager. Sizes every position to your budget before anything is bought: keeps a cash buffer, caps any one stock (the excess is shared out to the others), drops slices under your minimum order, rounds so every dollar is used, supports fractional or whole shares, and writes the proposed buy orders to trader/orders.json in the exact shape of Alpaca's place_stock_order (notional as a string). Nothing is placed. Use when the user says ""I have $5,000"", ""size my trades"", ""how much of each should I buy"", ""manage my budget"", ""split my money"", ""keep 10% in cash"", ""no stock over 25%"", ""set my rules"", or after /trader-copycat writes targets."
  - jake-trader-trader-copycat, Jake Trader Trader Copycat, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-copycat, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-copycat, assess_for_task, "The Reverse Engineer. Reads a famous investor's public SEC filings (the quarterly 13F-HR, plus Form 4 if you want the insider trades) and rebuilds their portfolio as weights you can copy: every position, its share of the fund, what they bought, added, trimmed and sold since the last quarter, with tickers matched to every CUSIP. Then it writes trader/targets.json so the budget skill can size it to your money. Use when the user says ""copy Buffett"", ""copy Berkshire"", ""what does Ackman own"", ""reverse engineer this investor"", ""show me their 13F"", ""what did they buy last quarter"", ""copy the top 5"", or names any fund or famous investor."
  - jake-trader-trader-news, Jake Trader Trader News, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-news, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-news, assess_for_task, "The News Monitor. Watches breaking market news and SEC filings for the stocks you hold (or are about to copy): Yahoo Finance headlines per ticker and each company's 8-K filings on SEC EDGAR (earnings, CEO changes, deals, restatements, bankruptcy). Shows only what is new since the last check, newest first, flags what touches your positions and why it matters, and never repeats an item. Use when the user says ""any news on my stocks"", ""what's happening with Apple"", ""monitor the news"", ""watch my portfolio"", ""did anything break"", ""check the 8-Ks"", or ""morning briefing""."
  - jake-trader-trader-pelosi, Jake Trader Trader Pelosi, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-pelosi, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-pelosi, assess_for_task, "The Pelosi Tracker. Watches the stock trades members of Congress must disclose under the STOCK Act: reads the House Clerk's public Periodic Transaction Reports (PTRs) as soon as they are posted, alerts once per new filing, and turns each PDF into clean rows (who, owner, stock, ticker, buy or sell, options strike and expiry, trade date, amount range, how many days it took to disclose). Flags trades in stocks you hold. Senate reports are covered by a documented manual route. Use when the user says ""what is Pelosi buying"", ""track Nancy Pelosi"", ""Congress trades"", ""politician stock trades"", ""did any congressman buy X"", ""alert me when Pelosi files"", or ""run the Pelosi skill""."
  - jake-trader-trader-rebalance, Jake Trader Trader Rebalance, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-rebalance, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-rebalance, assess_for_task, "Rebalancer. Brings the portfolio back to its target weights when it drifts: values every holding at current prices, works out each stock's drift from its target in percentage points, trades only the stocks outside a band (default 5 points), keeps the cash buffer and the per-stock cap, skips tiny trades, lists sells before buys, and writes the trades to trader/orders.json as proposals. Use when the user says ""rebalance"", ""my portfolio drifted"", ""bring it back to the targets"", ""I added money"", ""the new 13F changed the weights"", ""am I overweight"", or on a schedule (monthly or quarterly) after /trader-copycat updates the targets."
  - jake-trader-trader-risk, Jake Trader Trader Risk, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-risk, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-risk, assess_for_task, "Risk Manager. Checks every proposed order against your limits before it can reach the broker and blocks anything over them: blocked tickers, max order size, minimum order, max position percent after the fill, the cash buffer, margin, short sales, options and crypto (off unless allowed), malformed orders, duplicates and a daily order limit. Prints PASS or BLOCK with the reason for each order and records the verdicts so trader-broker only shows an order that passed. Use when the user says ""check my orders"", ""is this safe"", ""risk check"", ""does this break my rules"", ""can I place this"", or before /trader-broker, always."
  - jake-trader-trader-screener, Jake Trader Trader Screener, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-screener, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-screener, assess_for_task, "The Stock Screener. Checks a list of companies against the user's own rules (revenue growth, margins, EPS, P/E, earnings yield, sector, anything in the metrics file), says exactly which rule each company passes or fails and by how much, and ranks the ones that pass into a shortlist. Reads the metrics /trader-analyst writes from SEC filings, or any CSV. Use when the user says ""screen for stocks"", ""find me companies that"", ""filter my watchlist"", ""which of these pass my rules"", ""shortlist candidates"", ""rank these stocks"", or ""growing companies under 30 times earnings""."
  - jake-trader-trader-tax, Jake Trader Trader Tax, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-trader-trader-tax, .agents/skills/jake-trader-trader-tax, assess_for_task, "Tax Optimizer. Tracks cost-basis lots for every position (FIFO, highest cost first, or specific lots), shows unrealized gains and losses by lot with short or long term, works out what a sale would realize before you sell, finds tax-loss harvesting candidates over a loss threshold, checks the wash sale rule (30 days before and after, GOOG and GOOGL as one family), and writes harvest sells only as proposals. Not tax advice. Use when the user says ""what are my gains"", ""cost basis"", ""tax lots"", ""tax-loss harvest"", ""what would selling cost me in tax"", ""short or long term"", ""wash sale"", or before selling anything."
  - jake-unhinged-apollo-13, Jake Unhinged Apollo 13, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-apollo-13, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-apollo-13, assess_for_task, "Works a critical failure under hard constraints , limited options, no clean fix , to get the broken thing home with whatever you have; invoke via /apollo-13 when something important is down, the usual tools are unavailable, and you must improvise a survival fix."
  - jake-unhinged-autopilot-chaos, Jake Unhinged Autopilot Chaos, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-autopilot-chaos, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-autopilot-chaos, assess_for_task, "Takes the whole task and runs it end to end without stopping to ask, leaving the user to review at the finish line; invoke via /autopilot-chaos when you want a fully autonomous run and will inspect the result once it's done."
