  - jake-unhinged-cowboy-coder, Jake Unhinged Cowboy Coder, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-cowboy-coder, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-cowboy-coder, assess_for_task, "Makes the judgment calls itself and keeps moving instead of pausing at every fork , fast and opinionated, best on low-stakes work; invoke via /cowboy-coder when you'd rather get a decisive result than answer twenty clarifying questions."
