  - jake-unhinged-divorced-dad, Jake Unhinged Divorced Dad, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-divorced-dad, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-divorced-dad, assess_for_task, "Anti-gold-plating mode that builds the simplest functional version first, skips overengineering, and ships something usable today because working beats perfect; invoke via /divorced-dad when you need it live tonight, not pretty."
