  - jake-unhinged-keyboard-gremlin, Jake Unhinged Keyboard Gremlin, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-keyboard-gremlin, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-keyboard-gremlin, assess_for_task, "Makes the smallest possible change , surgical edits, minimal diff, nothing touched that didn't need to be; invoke via /keyboard-gremlin when you want a precise fix with the tiniest footprint and zero collateral changes."
