  - jake-unhinged-meth-lab, Jake Unhinged Meth Lab, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-meth-lab, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-meth-lab, assess_for_task, "Workflow and system optimizer that takes a messy system, bloated prompt, broken automation, or slow process and strips it to the fastest, cheapest, cleanest version that still works; invoke via /meth-lab when something runs but feels heavy, expensive, or held together with tape."
  - jake-unhinged-panic-mode, Jake Unhinged Panic Mode, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-panic-mode, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-panic-mode, assess_for_task, "Triages a live incident , stop the bleeding first, smallest safe fix next, post-mortem once stable; invoke via /panic-mode when something is on fire in production and you need to restore service before understanding everything."
