  - jake-unhinged-schizotech, Jake Unhinged Schizotech, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 1, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-schizotech, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-schizotech, assess_for_task, "Connects the dots nobody asked for , wild, lateral architecture ideas linking things you'd never pair on purpose; invoke via /schizotech when you want unconventional cross-domain inspiration, with the explicit understanding that you must filter it heavily."
  - jake-unhinged-sleep-deprived-founder, Jake Unhinged Sleep Deprived Founder, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-sleep-deprived-founder, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-sleep-deprived-founder, assess_for_task, "Cuts the backlog to the one or two things that actually move the needle and ignores the rest; invoke via /sleep-deprived-founder when you have too much to do and need ruthless prioritization, not a longer list."
  - jake-unhinged-speedrun, Jake Unhinged Speedrun, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-speedrun, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-speedrun, assess_for_task, "Finds the shortest path to done and takes it , no detours, no nice-to-haves; invoke via /speedrun when the only goal is to complete the task as fast as possible with nothing extra."
  - jake-unhinged-tax-fraud, Jake Unhinged Tax Fraud, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-tax-fraud, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-tax-fraud, assess_for_task, "Hunts cost everywhere , trims tokens, kills redundant calls, and reports the cheapest path to the same result; invoke via /tax-fraud when you want aggressive (but technically legal) cost optimization of an AI workflow, pipeline, or process."
  - jake-unhinged-weaponized-autism, Jake Unhinged Weaponized Autism, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-weaponized-autism, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-weaponized-autism, assess_for_task, "Obsessive-detail mode that reads every relevant file, checks every edge case, questions every assumption, and chases every dependency before answering; slower on purpose and far harder to fool , invoke via /weaponized-autism when a confident-but-wrong answer would be expensive, e.g. deep debugging, auditing, or high-stakes research."
  - jake-unhinged-zero-sleep, Jake Unhinged Zero Sleep, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-unhinged-zero-sleep, .agents/skills/jake-unhinged-zero-sleep, assess_for_task, "Holds the thread across a big multi-step build without losing the plot , long-haul endurance and context-keeping; invoke via /zero-sleep when a task spans many steps and hours and you need consistency from start to finish."
  - jake-whale-case-study, Jake Whale Case Study, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-case-study, .agents/skills/jake-whale-case-study, assess_for_task, "Case Study. Turns the first customer into proof, with their permission. Once the product has shipped, it writes a short before-and-after from their real numbers and their real words, and keeps it marked as a draft until they have approved that exact text in writing. Change a word and it asks again. Use when the user says ""case study"", ""testimonial"", ""customer story"", ""get a quote from them"", ""write up the result"", ""social proof"", ""can I use their name"", or once a customer has seen results."
  - jake-whale-demo-builder, Jake Whale Demo Builder, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-demo-builder, .agents/skills/jake-whale-demo-builder, assess_for_task, "Demo Builder. Builds a demo showing how your product solves the problem, before the product exists. Turns a small spec into one self-contained HTML page that runs anywhere with no server: sample records, one button, every row moving through its statuses and a total counting up, with a banner that always says it is a demo with sample data. Claude can then make it look and behave more like the real thing for this buyer. Use when the user says ""build a demo"", ""mock this up"", ""show how it would work"", ""I need something to show them"", ""prototype"", or ""make a clickable demo""."
  - jake-whale-follow-up, Jake Whale Follow Up, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-follow-up, .agents/skills/jake-whale-follow-up, assess_for_task, "Follow-Up. Keeps the deal moving. Tells you who is due today after a pitch or an offer, drafts the next note (a bump, something useful, a last note), waits for your yes, logs it, and stops at the first ""no"", the moment a demo is booked, after 3 follow-ups or after 30 days. Logs their replies and knows when it's your turn. Use when the user says ""follow up"", ""who do I need to follow up with"", ""they haven't replied"", ""chase"", ""nudge"", ""bump this"", ""they replied"", ""they said no"", or every morning."
  - jake-whale-launch-planner, Jake Whale Launch Planner, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 1, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-launch-planner, .agents/skills/jake-whale-launch-planner, assess_for_task, "Launch Planner. Plans the launch once it is paid for. Works backwards from the earliest date you promised a paying customer: requirements confirmed, feature complete, customers testing, fixes, first ship, then the rest. The public launch comes last, behind a gate that stays closed until someone has the product, nobody is late, and everything they paid for is built. Use when the user says ""launch plan"", ""when do we launch"", ""are we on track"", ""what's next"", ""plan the launch"", ""can we launch yet"", ""launch checklist"", or once customers have paid."
  - jake-whale-market-researcher, Jake Whale Market Researcher, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-market-researcher, .agents/skills/jake-whale-market-researcher, assess_for_task, "Market Researcher. Finds problems businesses already pay thousands to solve. Looks for money that is already leaving their accounts: vendors, agencies, outsourced services and salaried jobs that exist only because of one painful problem. Builds a table of the problem, who pays and what they pay today, with a source for every number or a clearly marked estimate with its working, then helps you pick the one to go after and sets up the board the other ten Whale skills share. Use when the user says ""what should I build"", ""find me a problem"", ""market research"", ""validate this idea"", ""who would pay for this"", ""what do businesses pay for"", or ""set up the whale skill""."
  - jake-whale-objection-handler, Jake Whale Objection Handler, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-objection-handler, .agents/skills/jake-whale-objection-handler, assess_for_task, "Objection Handler. Answers every objection, and knows a no when it hears one. Matches what they said (""it isn't built yet"", ""what if you never ship it"", ""why pay up front"", ""too expensive"", ""I need to ask my CFO"") to an honest answer filled in from your own terms, and shows why it works. A real no gets no answer at all: it stops the deal for good. Every answer is a draft for your yes. Use when the user says ""they said"", ""how do I answer this"", ""what do I say to"", ""they pushed back"", ""objection"", ""they think it's too expensive"", or pastes a reply they don't know how to answer."
  - jake-whale-offer-builder, Jake Whale Offer Builder, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-offer-builder, .agents/skills/jake-whale-offer-builder, assess_for_task, "Offer Builder. Writes the offer they can say yes to. One page: the problem in their own numbers, what they get, the price, the date it ships, and the way out, with the plain statement that it isn't finished yet. A lint refuses an offer that leaves any of that out or that leans on fake urgency, made-up proof and promises nobody can keep. Every offer waits for your yes. Use when the user says ""write the offer"", ""make them an offer"", ""offer page"", ""proposal"", ""one-pager"", ""what do I send them"", ""they asked for details"", or ""founding customer offer""."
  - jake-whale-pre-sale, Jake Whale Pre Sale, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-pre-sale, .agents/skills/jake-whale-pre-sale, assess_for_task, "Pre-Sale. Gets customers to pay up front, and uses what they ask for to build the exact product. Sets honest terms (it isn't finished, the date it ships, how they get their money back), checks them, prepares a Stripe Payment Link in your own account for one buyer, logs real payments, and tells you when enough companies have paid to call it validated. Then it holds you to the date: it flags every promise coming due and writes the delay notice with the refund offer. Use when the user says ""pre-sell"", ""pre-sale"", ""get them to pay up front"", ""take a deposit"", ""charge before I build"", ""send a payment link"", ""validate with money"", ""who has paid"", ""am I validated"", or ""they said yes""."
  - jake-whale-pricing, Jake Whale Pricing, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-pricing, .agents/skills/jake-whale-pricing, assess_for_task, "Pricing. Sets the price from what they pay today. Takes the money already leaving their account for this problem, works out the year, and gives three prices with what each one leaves them, or checks a price you already have in mind, with the working shown so it can be argued with. Then puts the chosen price on the deal. Use when the user says ""what should I charge"", ""pricing"", ""how much is this worth"", ""set the price"", ""founding price"", ""am I charging too little"", or before writing an offer."
  - jake-whale-requirements, Jake Whale Requirements, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-requirements, .agents/skills/jake-whale-requirements, assess_for_task, "Requirements. Turns what paying customers asked for into the build list. Captures each ask in their own words with the feature it becomes, merges the same feature across customers, and ranks the list by how much paid money is behind each line, so you build exactly what was paid for and nothing else. Asks from people who haven't paid wait on a separate list. Logs each customer confirming the list, and marks features done. Use when the user says ""what should I build"", ""requirements"", ""build list"", ""they asked for"", ""what did they want"", ""scope"", ""spec"", ""feature requests"", or right after a customer pays."
  - jake-whale-whale-hunter, Jake Whale Whale Hunter, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-whale-whale-hunter, .agents/skills/jake-whale-whale-hunter, assess_for_task, "Whale Hunter. Finds the decision makers and pitches them. Looks up who signs the check, who owns the budget and who feels the pain at a company you want as a customer, using public business sources only, then writes a short pitch to the right person: what they pay today, the demo, and one small ask. Every email waits for your yes and goes out from your own account, with the legal footer and a plain way to opt out. Use when the user says ""who decides at X"", ""find the decision maker"", ""find the CFO"", ""pitch them"", ""write the pitch"", ""cold email the buyer"", ""go after this company"", or ""hunt whales""."
  - jake-x-x-audit, Jake X X Audit, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill jake-x-x-audit, .agents/skills/jake-x-x-audit, assess_for_task, "Post-mortem on what the user has already published on X - which posts actually worked, why, and what to stop doing - from their own analytics export. Use when the user shares their X analytics CSV or past posts and asks ""what's working"", ""why did this flop"", ""read my analytics"", ""audit my account"", ""what should I double down on"", or wants to know whether links, threads or a posting time actually matter for them."
