  - linear-automation, Linear Automation, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill linear-automation, .agents/skills/linear-automation, assess_for_task, "Automate Linear tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): issues, projects, cycles, teams, labels. Always search tools first for current schemas."
  - linear-project-management, Linear Project Management, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill linear-project-management, .agents/skills/linear-project-management, assess_for_task, "Manage Linear issues, projects, and teams"
  - link-in-bio-and-traffic, Link In Bio And Traffic, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill link-in-bio-and-traffic, .agents/skills/link-in-bio-and-traffic, assess_for_task, "Link-in-bio and traffic strategy , convert social reach into clicks, subscribers, and owned audience. Use when someone wants to ""drive traffic from social,"" ""optimize my link in bio,"" ""get more clicks,"" ""turn followers into email subscribers / leads / sales,"" ""where do I put my link,"" or to convert reach into an owned audience. Turns rented reach into clicks and an OWNED audience: one clear action (not a link-dump), capture-before-sell, correct link placement per platform (in-post links are suppressed on X/LinkedIn/Facebook), and branded short links + UTM tracking. Uses the CLICK framework. Reads brand-profile + goals-and-kpis first. WoopSocial publishes the driving posts and places links where the API allows; the bio hub / landing page / email tool are external (3rd-party + human); clicks/conversions are read from those + GA4, never fabricated. Distinct from profile-optimization, social-selling-and-dm, email-and-newsletter, and lead-magnets-and-funnels."
  - linkedin-automation, Linkedin Automation, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill linkedin-automation, .agents/skills/linkedin-automation, assess_for_task, "Automate LinkedIn tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): create posts, manage profile, company info, comments, and image uploads. Always search tools first for current schemas."
  - linkedin-cli, Linkedin Cli, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill linkedin-cli, .agents/skills/linkedin-cli, assess_for_task, "Use when automating LinkedIn via CLI: fetch profiles, search people/companies, send messages, manage connections, create posts, and Sales Navigator."
  - linkedin-company-pages, Linkedin Company Pages, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill linkedin-company-pages, .agents/skills/linkedin-company-pages, assess_for_task, "The LinkedIn company-page (LINKEDIN_PAGES) growth strategy skill -- a separate platform from personal LINKEDIN. Use when someone wants to grow a company/business page, fix low page reach (""our LinkedIn page gets no engagement""), set up employee advocacy, or plan company-page content. In 2026 pages get a tiny share of feed reach, so the page is a credibility hub + paid launchpad (Ads + Thought Leader Ads), NOT the reach engine -- the growth lever is employee advocacy (people, not logos). Uses the HUMAN framework. Reads brand-profile + goals-and-kpis first. The agent strategizes, designs the advocacy program, and drafts page posts + advocacy content; WoopSocial publishes the page's own posts on a schedule; employees post from their OWN profiles (routes to linkedin-growth); first-hour engagement, Ads, and analytics stay human/native. No bait, pods, or bought followers; never fabricates metrics. Distinct from linkedin-growth (personal profile) and linkedin-post-writer (the post craft)."
  - linkedin-growth, Linkedin Growth, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill linkedin-growth, .agents/skills/linkedin-growth, assess_for_task, "The LinkedIn personal-profile growth playbook for 2026. Use when someone wants to ""grow on LinkedIn,"" ""get more LinkedIn followers/reach,"" ""a LinkedIn strategy,"" ""how the LinkedIn algorithm works,"" or how to use commenting/newsletters/video/connections to grow. Dwell time + early meaningful comments are the engine, personal profiles massively out-reach company pages, links go in the first comment, and strategic commenting on target accounts is the cheapest reach on the platform. Uses the LADDER framework. Reads brand-profile + voice-builder first. The agent drafts posts + comment copy and designs the system; a human does the live commenting/connecting/DMs; WoopSocial schedules posts; metrics come from native LinkedIn analytics (SSI as a directional check); nothing is fabricated. Single-post craft → linkedin-post-writer; company page → linkedin-company-pages."
  - linkedin-post-writer, Linkedin Post Writer, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill linkedin-post-writer, .agents/skills/linkedin-post-writer, assess_for_task, "Use to write a LinkedIn post , professional, thought-leadership, or founder/personal-brand content optimized for LinkedIn's specific mechanics (dwell time, early comments, the ""see more"" hook). Run when the user says ""write a LinkedIn post,"" ""LinkedIn,"" ""post this on LinkedIn,"" ""thought leadership post,"" ""founder post,"" or wants professional/B2B social content. Reads brand-profile and voice first, uses hook-writer for the opening line that must win the ""see more"" expand, formats for dwell, drives genuine comments, and routes links to the first comment to protect reach. Avoids LinkedIn cringe (broetry, engagement bait). This is the single-post craft: to ""grow on LinkedIn"" or set the account strategy use linkedin-growth; for company-page strategy use linkedin-company-pages; for general captions use caption-writer; for X threads use thread-writer; for the carousel slides use carousel-writer."
  - linkedin-profile-optimizer, Linkedin Profile Optimizer, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill linkedin-profile-optimizer, .agents/skills/linkedin-profile-optimizer, assess_for_task, "High-intent expert for LinkedIn profile checks, authority building, and SEO optimization. Invoke to audit, rewrite, and enhance profiles for top 1% positioning."
