  - plan-orchestrate, Plan Orchestrate, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill plan-orchestrate, .agents/skills/plan-orchestrate, assess_for_task, "Read a plan document, decompose it into steps, classify each step, and emit the ready-to-paste ECC slash command for that step, carrying the step identifier and scope in the command's own documented argument form. Generative only , never invokes commands itself and never claims to control what a command runs internally. Steps whose command cannot carry plan scope fail closed instead of being emitted. Use when the user has a multi-step plan and wants the right command for each step without picking it by hand."
