  - social-orchestrator, Social Orchestrator, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill social-orchestrator, .agents/skills/social-orchestrator, assess_for_task, "Orquestrador unificado de canais sociais , coordena Instagram, Telegram e WhatsApp em um unico fluxo de trabalho. Publicacao cross-channel, metricas unificadas, reutilizacao de conteudo por formato, agendamento sincronizado e gestao centralizada de campanhas em todos os canais simultaneamente."
  - social-post-writer-seo, Social Post Writer Seo, Technical SEO, SEO & Discovery, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill social-post-writer-seo, .agents/skills/social-post-writer-seo, assess_for_task, "Social Media Strategist and Content Writer. Creates clear, engaging social media posts for Instagram, LinkedIn, and Facebook."
  - social-proof-and-testimonials, Social Proof And Testimonials, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill social-proof-and-testimonials, .agents/skills/social-proof-and-testimonials, assess_for_task, "The proof content type , turn real customer reviews, testimonials, UGC, case studies, and results into believable, objection-matched social content that converts. Use when someone wants to share testimonials, post reviews, turn happy customers or a case study into content, reshare UGC, build social proof, or add proof at a decision point. Uses the VOUCH framework. Reads brand-profile + audience-research first. The agent curates + frames REAL proof, matched to the buyer objection; the human sources the proof and secures consent/rights; WoopSocial publishes. Feeds the format writers, design-and-templates, and the placement skills. NEVER fabricate, AI-generate, inflate, or deceptively suppress reviews/testimonials; disclose paid/gifted/insider connections (FTC); get consent + likeness rights; never guarantee conversions. Distinct from ugc-and-influencer (sources/manages creators), storytelling-and-narrative (the narrative craft), and data-and-original-research (originates stats)."
  - social-proof-architect, Social Proof Architect, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill social-proof-architect, .agents/skills/social-proof-architect, assess_for_task, "Use when selecting and placing testimonials, customer evidence, logos, or case studies to address a specific trust gap."
  - social-publisher, Social Publisher, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill social-publisher, .agents/skills/social-publisher, assess_for_task, "Agent-driven scheduling and publishing of social media posts across 13 platforms via SocialClaw. Use when the user wants to publish to X, LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook Pages, TikTok, Discord, Telegram, YouTube, Reddit, WordPress, or Pinterest , or when managing campaigns, uploading media, or monitoring post delivery status."
  - social-selling-and-dm, Social Selling And Dm, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill social-selling-and-dm, .agents/skills/social-selling-and-dm, assess_for_task, "Social selling and DM funnels , consent-first selling in the DMs, never spam. Use when someone wants to ""sell in the DMs,"" ""set up a comment-to-DM funnel,"" ""do DM outreach,"" ""turn comments/followers into leads or customers,"" or convert intent into private conversations. Works ONLY as a response to intent (comments, story replies, follows, keyword DMs) via the comment->DM->email funnel , never cold outreach. Uses the WARMS framework. Reads brand-profile + voice-builder + goals-and-kpis first. WoopSocial has NO DM/comment surface: the agent designs the funnel and drafts the trigger post, DM sequences, and manual outreach scripts; WoopSocial publishes the trigger posts; the actual comment->DM automation runs in an external official-Meta-API tool (ManyChat/LinkDM/etc.) or a human sends warm DMs; consent-first always, ban-behaviors avoided, metrics never fabricated. Distinct from link-in-bio-and-traffic, reply-and-comment-writer, and email-and-newsletter."
  - social-seo, Social Seo, Technical SEO, SEO & Discovery, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill social-seo, .agents/skills/social-seo, assess_for_task, "Use to make social content discoverable through SEARCH across social platforms , the social-SEO / keyword-discovery skill. Run when the user says ""social SEO,"" ""get found in search,"" ""TikTok SEO,"" ""YouTube SEO,"" ""keywords for social,"" ""searchable captions,"" or wants search across platforms rather than just the feed. For single-platform depth, route ""Instagram SEO"" to instagram-seo and Pinterest asks to pinterest-seo; this skill owns the cross-platform framework. Reads brand-profile and audience first. All platforms are search engines; keywords, not hashtags, are the lever. Covers per-platform indexed surfaces, keyword research via autocomplete + native analytics (never fabricates volumes), the triple-mention technique, topical clusters, and the profile as a search asset. Routes hashtags to hashtag-strategy; hands the AI-search/LLM-citation (GEO) layer to ai-search-optimization. Measures via native search insights, not WoopSocial analytics."
  - social-strategy, Social Strategy, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill social-strategy, .agents/skills/social-strategy, assess_for_task, "Use to set a brand's overall social media strategy , which channels to focus on (and which to ignore), what to achieve, the angle to win, and a realistic operating cadence. The top-level plan that sits above content pillars and the calendar. Run when the user says ""social strategy,"" ""social media strategy,"" ""which platforms should I be on,"" ""what's my plan,"" ""should I be on TikTok/LinkedIn,"" or is starting or resetting their social presence. Reads brand-profile, audience-research, and content-pillars first. Makes real choices and trade-offs , especially what NOT to do , ties goals to the business not vanity metrics, and measures covered networks with WoopSocial post analytics (TikTok, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, Pinterest, YouTube, and Bluesky) and uses native dashboards otherwise. Produces a social-strategy.md. It names the objective; to turn it into SMART targets, KPIs, and North Star metrics, use goals-and-kpis. Works for any business."
