  - strix-api-security-testing, Strix Api Security Testing, Security & Defense, Security, 1, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill strix-api-security-testing, .agents/skills/strix-api-security-testing, assess_for_task, "Security-test a REST, GraphQL, or gRPC API with Strix , autonomous agents that enumerate endpoints from an OpenAPI/GraphQL schema (or by crawling), then actually exploit the API-specific vulnerability classes in the OWASP API Security Top 10 (2023) , broken object-level authorization (BOLA/IDOR), broken object property level authorization (excessive data exposure and mass assignment), broken function-level authorization, unrestricted resource consumption, SSRF, injection, and auth/token flaws. Every finding comes with a working proof-of-concept request. Use when the user asks to pentest, security-test, audit, or find vulnerabilities in an API, endpoint, or backend service."
