  - zakariaf-lint-and-style-config, Zakariaf Lint And Style Config, Domain & Research Extensions, Specialized, 2, AGY CLI|Gemini|Claude Code|Codex, bin/agyos skill zakariaf-lint-and-style-config, .agents/skills/zakariaf-lint-and-style-config, assess_for_task, "Enforces a strict analysis_options.yaml built on very_good_analysis with strict-casts/strict-raw-types, a fixed set of silence-producing bug classes promoted to error (unawaited_futures, discarded_futures, empty_catches, use_build_context_synchronously, cancel_subscriptions, close_sinks, avoid_dynamic_calls, exhaustive_cases, avoid_print), dart format as the sole whitespace authority, generated-file excludes mirrored to coverage, and line-scoped-only suppression discipline; teaches the version-pinned-include trap (a missing include silently disables all rules), the errors-only-re-ranks-vs-linter-enables mechanic, and the sealed-switch analyze-vs-compile gap. Use when editing analysis_options.yaml, adding or disabling a lint, writing an `// ignore:`/`// ignore_for_file:`, bumping the Dart SDK or very_good_analysis version, wiring riverpod_lint, or explaining why discarded_futures, use_build_context_synchronously, close_sinks, or missing_provider_scope fires."
